            VoltSavings is an independent, 100% free financial modeling tool that computes the operational cost difference between petrol/diesel combustion engines and electric vehicles. You input your daily commute, fuel price, electricity rate, and efficiencies. The engine computes cost-per-km, annual savings, 5-year compounding ROI, and tailpipe CO₂ emissions avoided. For the full mathematical formulas, see our <a href="/methodology" class="text-emerald-600 font-bold underline">Methodology Page</a>.
